Summary of the batch:
- **Leaves** (no internal deps): `linbin`, `rlbin`, `blkest`, `cpblock`, `linbin2D`, `.onAttach`, `.onUnload` — each wraps a Fortran routine (except the two hooks) and was reimplemented natively in Python/NumPy since no Python ports existed.
